{"slug":"james-langevin","qid":"Q1397290","name":"Jim Langevin","desc":"U.S. Representative from Rhode Island","article":"James Langevin","born":"1964-04-22","died":null,"birthplace":"Providence","parties":["Democratic Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"RI-02","f":2001,"u":2023},{"t":"Secretary of State of Rhode Island","w":"","f":1995,"u":2001},{"t":"Rhode Island House of Representatives","w":"","f":1988,"u":1994}],"summary":"James R. Langevin ( LANN-jə-vinn; born April 22, 1964) is an American politician who served as the U.S. representative for Rhode Island's 2nd congressional district from 2001 to 2023. A member of the Democratic Party, he is the first quadriplegic to serve in Congress; Langevin was appointed to be the first quadriplegic speaker pro tempore of the U.S. House of Representatives in 2019. Langevin did not seek reelection in 2022.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":2020,"o":"H","k":"RI-02","p":"D","v":154086,"s":58.24,"w":true,"n":"James R Langevin"},{"y":2018,"o":"H","k":"RI-02","p":"D","v":126476,"s":63.49,"w":true,"n":"James R Langevin"},{"y":2016,"o":"H","k":"RI-02","p":"D","v":133108,"s":58.09,"w":true,"n":"James R Langevin"},{"y":2014,"o":"H","k":"RI-02","p":"D","v":105716,"s":62.22,"w":true,"n":"James R Langevin"},{"y":2012,"o":"H","k":"RI-02","p":"D","v":124067,"s":55.72,"w":true,"n":"James R Langevin"},{"y":2010,"o":"H","k":"RI-02","p":"D","v":104442,"s":59.79,"w":true,"n":"James R Langevin"},{"y":2008,"o":"H","k":"RI-02","p":"D","v":158416,"s":70.02,"w":true,"n":"James R Langevin"},{"y":2006,"o":"H","k":"RI-02","p":"D","v":140315,"s":72.69,"w":true,"n":"James R Langevin"},{"y":2004,"o":"H","k":"RI-02","p":"D","v":154392,"s":74.53,"w":true,"n":"James R Langevin"},{"y":2002,"o":"H","k":"RI-02","p":"D","v":129390,"s":76.29,"w":true,"n":"James R Langevin"},{"y":2000,"o":"H","k":"RI-02","p":"D","v":123805,"s":62.21,"w":true,"n":"James R Langevin"}]}